<div class="embla__slide">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <h2>Сложность модели данных (Data Model Complexity)</h2>
    <p style="color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 30px;">Оценка сложности архитектуры на основе словарей доменов (Domain Dictionary).</p>
    {% set data_model_metrics = scope_analytics.data_model_metrics | default({}, true) %}

    <div class="dashboard-grid" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
      <div class="metric-card" style="justify-content: flex-start;">
        <div class="metric-value">{{ data_model_metrics.total_entities | default(0) }}</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Всего сущностей (Entities)</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">{{ data_model_metrics.aggregate_roots | default(0) }} Aggregate Roots / {{ data_model_metrics.value_objects | default(0) }} Value Objects</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card" style="justify-content: flex-start;">
        <div class="metric-value text-blue">{{ data_model_metrics.total_attributes | default(0) }}</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Всего атрибутов (Attributes)</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex justify-center w-full">
      <div class="metric-card w-full md:w-1/2 justify-start">
        <div class="metric-value text-green">{{ data_model_metrics.total_relationships | default(0) }}</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Определено связей (Relationships)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
